COBR Unit summary for officials.

- Fenella: Active response. the Cumbria LRF and Lancashire Local Resilience Forum lead the local response. MHCLG RED provides the central government liaison.
- Penrith water contamination: ACTIVE - response. UU Water is the lead responder. UKHSA North West and Drinking Water Inspectorate are engaged.

No request for central support at this time beyond the military aid already approved.
Contact the COBR Unit duty desk for queries. DLUHC colleagues please note the change of distribution list.

